## Quick Definitions

Docker = Container platform.

Container = Lightweight isolated application environment.

Docker Image = Blueprint for containers.

Dockerfile = Instructions to build images.

Docker Compose = Tool for managing multiple containers.

CI = Continuous Integration.

CD = Continuous Delivery/Deployment.

Jenkins = Automation server for CI/CD.

Pipeline = Automated workflow.

GitHub Actions = GitHub's CI/CD platform.
